Local patch: solver/cg.hpp and solver/bicgstab.hpp guard std::cout usage
with #ifndef AMGCL_RCPP_NO_OUTPUT. RcppAMGCL.h defines this macro to suppress
upstream console access; solver arithmetic is unchanged. This also avoids
access to process-wide iostream state while running R package code.

Local patch: wrap OpenMP pragma directives in #ifdef _OPENMP / #endif in
the following active CPU-backend headers so serial builds compile without
unknown-pragma warnings or compiler diagnostic suppression. The directives
and numerical code are unchanged when OpenMP is enabled:
  backend/builtin.hpp
  backend/detail/matrix_ops.hpp
  coarsening/plain_aggregates.hpp
  coarsening/pointwise_aggregates.hpp
  coarsening/smoothed_aggregation.hpp
  coarsening/tentative_prolongation.hpp
  detail/spgemm.hpp
  relaxation/spai0.hpp
  reorder/cuthill_mckee.hpp
